[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0000","text":"？？？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0001","text":"？？？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0002","text":"电视声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0003","text":"？？？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0010","text":"──呐\n终于要来了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0020","text":"嗯……！\n好紧张…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0030","text":"（今天，从这里……\n　新的时代即将开始────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0040","text":"『──据观测，这是史上最大级别的\n　能将那光辉尽收眼底的，是──』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0050","text":"——是郁田，阳希吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0060","text":"……！\n是的……！　我是郁田阳希"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0061","text":"羽那"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0070","text":"请多多关照……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0080","text":"哇──！\n我是铃木羽那，请多关照啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0090","text":"……她们俩是这个月刚进事务所的伙伴\n所以，算是同期"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0100","text":"──那么说，\n我们俩要作为同期组个组合吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0110","text":"不──……\n不是那样的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0120","text":"诶──\n这样啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0130","text":"──只是，虽然平时的活动是分开的\n但希望你们能互相意识到对方，切磋琢磨"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0140","text":"在练习或工作中，\n说不定也会有一起的时候"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0150","text":"────话说回来\n阳希酱…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0160","text":"……！\n……怎么了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0170","text":"……总觉得\n有种都市女孩的感觉──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0180","text":"诶……没有那回事……！\n要说的话，铃木小姐才是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0190","text":"哦……是吗\n你们俩都是从地方来的啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0200","text":"阳希是从长野\n羽那，是最近刚从冈山出来的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_00_0210","text":"诶──……！"}]
